re battles  without being able to hear  right away we get a funny scene where  killer explains that the attacks will  only reach them  if they can hear them and if they can  hear them then the attacks are  unavoidable  but of course the other 3 worst  generation pirates didn't hear a word  because they have their ears covered i  really love this about one piece  that even in super hype situations oda  has time to sprinkle in that humor  as our four supernovas run people get  excited by the amount of worst  generation pirates here  and how they could grow their own  reputations by taking them out  killer because of his failed smile is  called a pleasure by some of the  bystanders  and we find out that he ate it because  orochi told him that would give him a  chance to save his captain  and wow that just further increases my  respect for killer  kid and killer definitely have a great  friendship going on and they're both  clearly loyal af which is a good sign  while luffy tells kid once again not to  cause a scene  they are spotted by who's who from up  above he recognizes them as  udon escapees we were told recently that  the flying six were all  captains of crews and so it makes sense  that who's who  has his own crew that he leads the crew  wonders if they should go help with  escapees but who's who is more concerned  with finding kaido's son yamato  he knows that's the biggest win for him  and makes it clear that that's the  crew's first priority  he also mentions that he doesn't want to  lose to sasaki  so he clearly views him as his biggest  rival in the flying six  the theme for his own crew seems to be a  cross between batman with horns  and catwoman since there do seem to be  some nicely dressed and tailed cat girls  at who's whose side  and again potential problems and kaido's  crew are highlighted because instead of  wanting what's best for the crew  who's who seems more concerned with  beating sasuke  remember that sasuke and who's who are  both hoping to challenge an  all-star and queen mentioned that he'd  erase one of the flying six last chapter  now who's who seems to be responding to  that as he says that he  also wants to wipe somebody out clearly  this moment implies that they might have  beef with each other  although there's also the possibility  that they don't mean each other  specifically  it definitely would make sense to go  after jack in my view  if you had to fight an all-star because  he seems to be the weakest link at this  point  but if who's who is confident about  going after queen 2  that's just insane how strong he might  be and by extension the muscle power  that kaido has within his crew  would also be off the charts although  who's who may even want to use  queen if it gives him the opportunity to  get rid of his flying six rival  we then finally get to big mom who's  been changing for a while it feels like  there is some confusion here there's  mention of a ship with big mom's family  being in good shape they should arrive  soon but there's also mention  of it being strange that there's been no  sign at the appointed port  there's a conversation going on here but  we only see big mom is she talking to  someone or is she talking to herself and  the split personality that developed  when she lost her memories  is this another clue that she'll work  against kaido we'll have to wait and see  we jump to kinemon since it seems clear  that kaido doesn't know about their  plans  they'll change up their strategy a bit  rather than the whole force going to the  rear entrance  they'll split in two one group will take  a shortcut and pose as the enemy while  the other half of the pincer move goes  around  they hope to trap kaido and orochi like  that although even the idea of trying to  corner kaido sounds pretty crazy  unexpectedly they realize that the 2000  of them  will have to cross a bridge right next  to a brothel  the chance of not raising suspicion in  such a scenario  is pretty much zero while kinemon is  worried sanji is overjoyed  we find out that the sexy giant black  maria is the one who rules over the  brothel  which is an interesting development  hopefully we don't get in a situation  where sanji has to fight black maria  because that would definitely not turn  out well  as sanji is drawn magnetically to black  maria's domain  nami shinobu and karachon suggest that  they'll join him as a search team for  momonosuke  so kinemon doesn't have to worry about  him and he can focus on the battle ahead  of him we see how much kinemon's been  worrying about momonosuke  which is touching but a part of me  believes that momonosuke  will carry out his promise and find a  way to escape on his own  i feel like that will be an important  step for his development into a strong  leader  sanji comes out more depressed than  you've ever seen him and perhaps even  more depressed than you've ever seen  usopp the question in our minds is what  could possibly have happened to make  sanji so sad  he reveals that he wasn't able to find  any ladies  then in a hilarious stream of events we  figure out that luffy causing a scene  actually led to the brothel being  emptied out  so it worked out swimmingly this feels  like that will of the luck that seems to  be following luffy  things work out perfectly so that they  can cross the bridge  they split up as previously mentioned  then the team with kinemon and chopper  see that there is someone in one of the  windows  as big mom herself opens the window  everyone hides in time except of course  chopper who was pretty much an unwilling  friend to her when she lost her memories  he even told her her name was olin just  as a shocked chopper makes  eye contact with a mellow seeming big  mom we jump scenes again  now the question is is this gonna be a  huge hiccup  since one of the yonko discovered them  or is chopper going to be able to use  big mom or rather olin to their  advantage  perhaps some recurring head damage will  lead to some truly crazy  twists but we'll have to wait another  chapter at least to find out  but whatever happens it makes for a huge  cliffhanger we then jump to the upper  waterfall of wano and we see  charlotte perospero saying he won't  forget what king did  remember in what was one of the funniest  moments in one piece  king turned into his pterodactyl form  and knocked their ship down the  waterfall last time  so they couldn't make it to wano that's  when big mom fell off into the water and  lost her memories  while the rest of the family stayed on  the falling ship so this is take two and  pero sparrow is pretty confused  he says that an alliance with the beast  pirates is insane  and he's questioning what big mom is  thinking the idea of sanity is brought  up again and big mom's unstable mental  condition  definitely seems like it will be an  important variable during the rest of  the arc  we see other family members including  sweet commander charlotte smoothie  who seems on board with whatever big mom  decides  while the others emphasize that getting  payback on luffy is the big thing here  he insulted big mom's reputation and so  they gotta make him pay or the big mom  pirates seem weak  having a yonko's crew wanting to kill  you this badly is pretty crazy  and it shows how much of an impact  luffy's been able to make on this world  up until now then just as they're making  it to wano  pero sparrow remembers that it was  around this point  that king pushed him off the last time  he still clearly has ptsd  from the incident and it doesn't help  when he sees something in the air  could it be king again but no we turned  the page  and it's freaking marco the phoenix one  of the few  other flying zone users and former  numero uno commander  of the whitebeard pirates i gotta say  when i first saw him on the page  my heart literally felt like it skipped  a beat and all hype limiters were  smashed  this is huge but it doesn't stop there  exactly like  king marco knocks them off so they can't  make it to wano  will they even try a third time knowing  that they might just go through the same  humiliation again and again  worst case scenario marco has bought  significant time  and he suggests suggested that time will  be enough saying that the next time they  make it up  this age of ours might look a lot  different  meaning the big mom pirates will be too  late for the fight  we then see nekomamushi and izo both of  whom were former retainers for odin  and also served as members of the  whitebeard pirates especially ezo  who stayed and became the 16th division  commander  finally we have the successors of the  whitebeard pirates helping the  successors of odin's will  it would have been cool if whitebeard  helped odin fight kaido  but it's still very cool to see marco  and perhaps quite a bit more of the  former whitebeard pirates  here to help luffy and wano whitebeard  and luffy had a good relationship and  whitebeard wanted him protected as did  ace obviously  so it isn't a surprise that marco wants  to help luffy and having a yonko level  crew for allies  is beyond epic now obviously we don't  know how many people from the original  crew made it here after they lost to  blackbeard in the payback war  but nevertheless having someone like  marco enter the mix  is very significant in a few pages we  went from our boys taking on two yonko  and their crews  to only having to take on one crew and  having the help of marco and former  whitebeard pirates  this really changes everything about  this war and without her family there to  talk some sense into her we might be  seeing more of olin  and less of big mom things are finally  beginning to seem like they may not be  completely impossible for the straw hats  and that's saying a lot considering they  were planning on taking down two yonko  just a chapter ago  i really love this about shonen some  people might call this stuff  an unrealistically convenient turn of  events but i view